   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The days of the week",
     "texto": [
      "Unlike in English, days are written with a lowercase letter. To say «on Monday», «on Tuesday»… **в** + accusative is used. Before **вторник**, **во** is used to make pronunciation easier: **во вторник**.",
      "The three days of the week that end in -а change to **-у** in this expression: среда → **в среду**, пятница → **в пятницу**, суббота → **в субботу**.",
      "**Выходные** = the weekend."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
